  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fmakeship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/slabfish_plush.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/banner/personality.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fblueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/blueprint\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"網站\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/website\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"X\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/x\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fpatreon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/patreon\"></a>\n</p><h3>📖 概述：</h3><p>Personality 透過引入一系列新的動作與動畫，為玩家增添更多生動氣息。這些包括用於坐下和爬行的按鍵綁定，以及攀爬動畫。</p><p>Personality 也新增了數個可設定的調整項目，如下所示：</p><ul>\n<li>可裝備的旗幟</li>\n<li>飄落的積雪層</li>\n<li>釣魚鉤模型</li>\n<li>地獄幽靈攻擊動畫</li>\n<li>大型村民幼童頭部</li>\n<li>村民睡覺時閉上眼睛</li>\n<li>染色剪毛綿羊的覆蓋材質</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fblueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/blueprint.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fabnormals_delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/abnormals_delight.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fallurement\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/allurement.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fatmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/atmospheric.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fautumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/autumnity.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fberry_good\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/berry_good.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fboatload\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/boatload.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fbuzzier_bees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/buzzier_bees.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fcaverns_and_chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/caverns_and_chasms.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fclayworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/clayworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fendergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/endergetic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fenvironmental\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/environmental.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fgallery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/gallery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%